Package: achilles-financials
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: lcsfls <info@it-flores.de>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: adduser, systemd
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/lcsfls/achilles-financials
Description: Self-hosted private wealth dashboard
 Achilles Financials tracks accounts, investments, precious metals, pensions,
 loans, real estate and business value in one place, on your own hardware.
 Bank data is fetched over PSD2; nothing leaves the machine except the calls
 to your bank and to public price sources.
 .
 The package ships its own Node runtime, so it does not depend on the
 distribution's Node version. Data lives in /var/lib/achilles-financials and
 is preserved across upgrades and removal (purge deletes it).
